# Never commit these. Everything below is either downloaded by `tofu init`,
# generated by a run, or (state) can contain secrets in plain text.
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
crash.*.log
*.tfplan
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf

# Files the Track A sandbox writes when you `apply`
sandbox/out/

# The lock file (.terraform.lock.hcl) is NOT ignored on purpose:
# it is committed so everyone gets the same provider versions.
